# Public construction and configuration contracts are declared in data files.

```console
$ lithos-llm-e2e requests requests.json
{
  "kind": "requests",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "full",
      "result": "ok",
      "model": "fixture/model",
      "messages": 4,
      "tools": 2,
      "tool_choice": {
        "type": "tool",
        "name": "lookup"
      },
      "response_format": {
        "type": "json_schema",
